---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Soporte IA clínico — MediQ"
  description="MediQ resume historiales, sugiere diagnósticos diferenciales y verifica interacciones en segundos, entrenado sobre literatura médica revisada por pares."
  navActive="/"
>

<!-- ─── Estilos específicos de index ─── -->
<!--
  Usamos is:global porque este bloque contiene selectores sobre :root,
  [data-theme], [data-type], [data-style] y elementos de nivel html/body
  que Astro no puede escopar a nivel de componente.
-->
<style is:global>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;

    /* CLINICAL (default) */
    --bg: #f6f5f1;
    --bg-2: #efede6;
    --ink: #161a1d;
    --ink-soft: #3c4246;
    --ink-mute: #7a7f82;
    --rule: #1e23270d;
    --rule-2: #1e232714;
    --accent: oklch(54% 0.09 195);
    --accent-ink: #ffffff;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --warn: oklch(62% 0.14 40);

    --f-display: "Fraunces", "Newsreader", Georgia, serif;
    --f-body: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    --f-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;

    --radius: 10px;
    --radius-sm: 6px;
    --container: 1240px;
    --pad: clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);
  }

  [data-theme="paper"] {
    --bg: #f3ecdf; --bg-2: #e8dfcd; --ink: #211a13; --ink-soft: #4a3f32;
    --ink-mute: #8a7d6a; --rule: #2b1f0f10; --rule-2: #2b1f0f18;
    --accent: oklch(52% 0.13 45); --surface: #fbf6ec;
  }
  [data-theme="ink"] {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --bg: #0e1113; --bg-2: #14181b; --ink: #f2f0ea; --ink-soft: #c6c3ba;
    --ink-mute: #7f837f; --rule: #f2f0ea14; --rule-2: #f2f0ea22;
    --accent: oklch(78% 0.13 155); --accent-ink: #0e1113; --surface: #191d20;
  }

  [data-type="editorial"] { --f-display: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif; --f-body: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif; }
  [data-type="serif-soft"] { --f-display: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif; --f-body: "Newsreader", Georgia, serif; }
  [data-type="plex"] { --f-display: "IBM Plex Sans", system-ui, sans-serif; --f-body: "IBM Plex Sans", system-ui, sans-serif; }

  /* Type scale (valores propios de index, más grandes que global.css) */
  h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 7.2vw, 112px); line-height: 0.98; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 68px); line-height: 1.02; }
  h3 { font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px); line-height: 1.15; }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(17px, 1.3vw, 20px); line-height: 1.5; }
  .italic { font-style: italic; }

  /* Hero */
  .hero { padding: clamp(40px, 8vw, 96px) 0 clamp(56px, 10vw, 120px); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: end; }
  @media (min-width: 960px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: 64px; } }
  .hero h1 .wa { display: inline-block; }
  .hero h1 em { font-family: var(--f-display); font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-meta { display: flex; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-top: 32px; }
  .hero-meta .dot { width: 4px; height: 4px; background: var(--ink-mute); border-radius: 50%; }
  .hero-cta { margin-top: 36px; display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .hero-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--rule), 0 20px 60px -40px #0000001a; font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); position: relative; }
  .hero-card .head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .hero-card .pill { background: var(--bg-2); color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .hero-card .pulse { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 60%, transparent); display: inline-block; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
  @keyframes pulse { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 60%, transparent); } 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px transparent; } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 transparent; } }
  .msg { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 10px 0; }
  .msg .role { width: 16px; color: var(--ink-mute); }
  .msg p { color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--f-body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .msg.ai p { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .msg.ai p b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .typing { display: inline-flex; gap: 3px; }
  .typing i { width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink-mute); }
  @keyframes blink { 0%, 80%, 100% { opacity: .3; } 40% { opacity: 1; } }

  /* Section chrome */
  section { padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 140px) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); position: relative; }
  .section-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; max-width: 900px; margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); }
  .section-head .lede { margin-top: 8px; }

  /* Steps */
  .steps { display: grid; gap: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr; gap: 32px; padding: 36px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); align-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 820px) { .step { grid-template-columns: 96px 1.6fr 2fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; } }
  .step .num { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .step h3 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 400; }
  .step p { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 48ch; }
  .step .tag { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }

  /* Features */
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1px; background: var(--rule-2); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
  @media (min-width: 720px) { .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (min-width: 1040px) { .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
  .feat { background: var(--bg); padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); min-height: 260px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }
  .feat .num { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
  .feat h3 { font-size: clamp(22px, 1.7vw, 26px); }
  .feat p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .feat .glyph { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--bg-2); display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  details.q { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 24px 0; }
  details.q summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 22px); line-height: 1.3; }
  details.q summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details.q .ans { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 70ch; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
  details.q .ic { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform .25s ease, background .2s ease; }
  details.q[open] .ic { transform: rotate(45deg); background: var(--bg-2); }

  /* Resources */
  .resources { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .resources { grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr; grid-auto-rows: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .post.featured { grid-row: span 2; }
  }
  .post { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--surface); transition: transform .3s ease, border-color .3s ease; }
  .post:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .post .cover { aspect-ratio: 16/10; background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-2) 0 2px, transparent 2px 10px), var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--ink-mute); font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .post.featured .cover { aspect-ratio: 21/10; }
  .post .meta { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
  .post .meta .pill-next { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 14%, transparent); color: var(--accent-text); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .post h3 { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25; }
  .post.featured h3 { font-size: 26px; }
  .post p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .post.secondary { padding: 20px; gap: 10px; }
  .post.secondary .cover { display: none; }
  .post.secondary h3 { font-size: 17px; }
  .post.secondary p { font-size: 13.5px; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; }

  /* CTA strip */
  .cta-strip { padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 120px) 0; text-align: center; }
  .cta-strip h2 em { font-family: var(--f-display); font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--accent); }
  .cta-strip .lede { margin: 20px auto 28px; text-align: center; }

  /* Footer */
  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 48px 0 36px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14px; }
  .foot-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  @media (min-width: 820px) { .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
  .foot-col h4 { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--ink-mute); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .foot-col a { display: block; padding: 4px 0; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .foot-col a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .foot-muted { display: block; padding: 4px 0; color: var(--ink-mute); cursor: default; }
  .foot-bot { margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  /* Scroll animations — opacidad siempre 1 para evitar pantalla en blanco
     en View Transitions; la animación es solo de posición (slide suave). */
  .reveal { transform: translateY(18px); transition: transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); transition-delay: var(--d, 0ms); }
  .reveal.in { transform: none; }
  .word-reveal .w { display: inline-block; transform: translateY(.4em); transition: transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
  .word-reveal.in .w { transform: none; }

  /* Tweaks panel */
  .tweaks-panel { position: fixed; right: 20px; bottom: 20px; z-index: 100; width: 300px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px #00000040; display: none; font-family: var(--f-body); }
  .tweaks-panel.open { display: block; }
  .tweaks-panel h4 { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-mute); font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .tweaks-panel .row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .tweaks-panel label { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .seg { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; padding: 3px; background: var(--bg-2); border-radius: 8px; }
  .seg button { padding: 8px 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .seg button.on { background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--rule-2); }
  .tweaks-panel input[type=text] { border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 10px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); outline: none; }
  .tweaks-panel input[type=text]:focus { border-color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .swatch-row { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .swatch { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; }
  .swatch.on { border-color: var(--ink); }

  /* Visual style: technical */
  [data-style="technical"] h1, [data-style="technical"] h2, [data-style="technical"] h3 { font-family: var(--f-body); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  [data-style="technical"] h1 em { font-family: var(--f-display); }
  [data-style="technical"] .hero-card, [data-style="technical"] .plan, [data-style="technical"] .post, [data-style="technical"] .features { border-radius: 6px; }

  .ico { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ─── Stats strip ─── */
  .stats-strip {
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg);
    padding: 22px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 80%, transparent);
  }
  .stats-inner {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 0; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .stat-item {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    gap: 3px; padding: 12px 28px; text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1;
    color: var(--bg);
  }
  .stat-lbl {
    font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--bg) 60%, transparent);
  }
  .stat-div {
    width: 1px; height: 36px; background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--bg) 18%, transparent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .stat-div { display: none; }
    .stat-item { padding: 10px 18px; }
    .stats-inner { gap: 0; justify-content: space-around; }
  }

  /* ─── Testimonials ─── */
  .testimonials-section em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
  .center-head { text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .center-head .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) { .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (min-width: 1040px) { .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
  .tcard {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 28px);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px; margin: 0;
    transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }
  .tcard:hover { border-color: var(--ink-soft); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .tcard-quote {
    font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 300; font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.45; flex: 1;
  }
  .tcard-quote::before { content: '\201C'; }
  .tcard-quote::after  { content: '\201D'; }
  .tcard-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .tcard-ava {
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, oklch(75% 0.1 195), oklch(55% 0.12 25));
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 14px; color: var(--bg);
  }
  .tcard-name { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; color: var(--ink); }
  .tcard-role { display: block; font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-mute); margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ─── prefers-reduced-motion guards ─── */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hero-card .pulse { animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
    .typing i { animation: blink 1.2s infinite; }
    .typing i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .2s; }
    .typing i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .4s; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-card .pulse { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
    .typing i { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* ─── Mobile Polish ─── */
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-cta { flex-direction: column; }
    .hero-cta .btn { justify-content: center; }
    .hero-card { padding: 16px; }
    .hero-card .msg p { font-size: 13px; }
    .step { grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .tweaks-panel { width: min(300px, calc(100vw - 32px)); right: 16px; bottom: 16px; }
    .foot-bot { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 10px; }
    .post { min-height: auto; }
    .resources { gap: 16px; }
    .cta-strip .lede { text-align: center; }
  }
</style>

<!-- ═══════════════════ HERO ═══════════════════ -->
<header id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">Soporte clínico con IA · Beta 2026</span>
      <h1 class="word-reveal" style="margin-top:20px;">
        La segunda opinión que <em>nunca duerme.</em> Consulta. Confirma. Decide.
      </h1>
      <p class="lede reveal" style="--d:160ms; margin-top:28px;">
        <span data-brand>MediQ</span> resume historiales, sugiere diagnósticos diferenciales y verifica interacciones
        en segundos — entrenado sobre literatura médica revisada por pares y guías clínicas vigentes.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta reveal" style="--d:240ms;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/demo" onclick="window.track('Hero CTA',{action:'probar_demo'})">Probar la demo — sin registro <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/login">Crear cuenta gratis</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta reveal" style="--d:320ms;">
        <span>RGPD · datos en la UE</span><span class="dot"></span>
        <span>Cifrado TLS 1.3</span><span class="dot"></span>
        <span>Auditable por especialistas</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-card reveal" style="--d:200ms;">
      <div class="head">
        <span><span class="pulse"></span><span data-brand>MediQ</span> · sesión #4812</span>
        <span class="pill">Cardiología</span>
      </div>
      <div class="msg">
        <span class="role">Dr.</span>
        <p>Varón 58a, dolor torácico opresivo 40 min, irradia a brazo izquierdo. ECG: supradesnivel ST en DII, DIII, aVF.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="msg ai">
        <span class="role" style="color:var(--accent);">AI</span>
        <p>
          <b>Hallazgo:</b> IAM de cara inferior. <b>Acción prioritaria:</b> ASA 300 mg, oxígeno si SatO₂&lt;94%, activar código infarto.
          <br />Riesgo de compromiso de VD (50%) — revisar V4R antes de nitratos.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="msg">
        <span class="role">Dr.</span>
        <p>¿Protocolo local para PCI primario?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="msg ai">
        <span class="role" style="color:var(--accent);">AI</span>
        <p><span class="typing"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═══════════════════ STATS STRIP ═══════════════════ -->
<div class="stats-strip" aria-label="Cifras clave">
  <div class="container stats-inner">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-num">+2 400</span>
      <span class="stat-lbl">consultas respondidas</span>
    </div>
    <span class="stat-div" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-num">96%</span>
      <span class="stat-lbl">satisfacción clínica</span>
    </div>
    <span class="stat-div" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-num">14 días</span>
      <span class="stat-lbl">prueba gratis · sin tarjeta</span>
    </div>
    <span class="stat-div" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-num">&lt; 8s</span>
      <span class="stat-lbl">tiempo de respuesta medio</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════ HOW IT WORKS ═══════════════════ -->
<section id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Cómo funciona</span>
      <h2>Tres pasos entre una duda clínica y una respuesta fundamentada.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="num">01 —</span>
        <h3>Describe el caso</h3>
        <p>Ingresa síntomas, laboratorios o la historia clínica completa. Acepta voz, texto, PDFs y DICOM para imágenes.</p>
        <span class="tag">30s</span>
      </div>
